            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We’re so glad to hear you loved the home and enjoyed the location! It’s wonderful that it worked out perfectly for your family vacation. Thank you for staying with us, and we’d be delighted to host you again anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Loved everything about this home. Location is perfect.Short walk to beach, restaurants, shopping. Perfect family vacation.",
