        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 30, 2025",
            "id": "55bd8e43-ccbc-4b33-a2d4-a361a56fbc15",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind words! We’re thrilled to hear that your family enjoyed the home, the pool, and the beach, and that the A/C and indoor entertainment helped keep everyone comfortable. It’s wonderful to know you had such a relaxing summer trip, and we’d be delighted to welcome you back anytime in the future!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Quick summer trip for the entire family before College starts back. The home is the entire package with many bonuses. We had perfect weather so the bulk of our time was at the Beach and beside the pool. Comfortable (A/C kept us cool), Quite and plenty of entertainment available inside the home. I would definetely stay at this home again in the future.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Another Successful Stay on Elysee!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Mike M.",
        "date": "2026-03-13T00:10:47Z",
        "id": "69b364268fda6e38453fbaa3",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Mar 19, 2026",
            "id": "6ce0371b-1c25-418e-bc7e-d3830066c8ae",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback, and we’re glad to hear you enjoyed the home and its location.\n\nWe appreciate you bringing these items to our attention. Our records do show that our team responded promptly during your stay, including sending a technician to assess the concerns and document them so we could ensure everything was properly addressed. Our records do show that our tech was there and not only took photos but addressed any concerns you had.\n\nRegarding the beach service, we do want to clarify that this vendor is officially contracted with the private beach access for this property, and we have not experienced issues with them in the past. We’re very sorry to hear about your interaction, as this is not typical, and we will be addressing this directly with them.\n\nWe appreciate your feedback and the opportunity to continue improving the guest experience.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house is lovely great location. We did have multiple minor issues that unfortunately add up to downgrade the experience. Second floor guest bathtub stopper didn’t work outside shower was cracked and sprayed water everywhere a few bug issues in the pantry kitchen, which can be expected in South Florida the trim piece on the island would fall every time you opened the dishwasher. It actually smashed my toe the first time, but not seriously. The guidebook says to text Jonathan the chair guy each morning with our chair request. My daughter was the first one there and got yelled at by Jonathan saying we shouldn’t be using his personal text which is the number they gave us. We did address these issues with management and they sent over a handyman, but he never fixed anything only took pictures.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
